  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Hepta Twist is an elastic seven-sided twisted co-polyester designed for players seeking maximum spin potential and strong power generation. Its heptagonal geometry and twisted construction increase ball bite and rotation, while the elastic co-polyester material supports lively response and comfort. The 1.15 and 1.20 mm gauges emphasize spin, acceleration and feel, the 1.25 mm version provides the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "MSV Hepta Twist 是一款采用七边形并进行扭转处理的弹性共聚酯球线，核心定位是极高旋转潜力和强力量输出。七边形截面配合扭转结构能够进一步增强球线对网球的咬合与旋转，而弹性共聚酯材料则提供更活跃、更舒适的击球反馈。1.15 和 1.20 毫米版本更强调旋转、加速与手感；1.25 毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30 毫米则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

